--></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\">Bernard</a> which causes him to embrace the player character.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The writing on this torn-out strip of paper is shaky and blotted with tears, making it barely legible.]\n</p><p><br>\nThe silence stretches on - I'm all alone.\n</p><p>Please, can I hold your hands, for just a while?\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195324\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1487/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23640/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5554/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935575/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.713      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.713      1 -total\n 49.75%   20.752      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.13%   18.406     15 Template:Trim\n 23.62%    9.851      2 Template:Uid\n 16.81%    7.010      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.24%    5.941      2 Template:Icon_link\n 13.65%    5.694      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.25%    4.277      1 Template:Notes\n  9.81%    4.094      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12798-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195324 and revision id 359875. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}